ajazz-sysmon — native cross-platform hardware monitor for AJAZZ Control Center

This component reuses source code from the following projects:

- btop++ (https://github.com/aristocratos/btop)
  Copyright (c) 2021 Aristocratos (jakob@qvantnet.com)
  Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.
  The metrics-helper links btop's collector translation units
  (src/btop_shared.cpp, src/btop_config.cpp, src/btop_tools.cpp,
  src/btop_log.cpp, src/linux/btop_collect.cpp) to read system/hardware
  metrics. btop is vendored unmodified as a git submodule under
  plugins/ajazz-sysmon/metrics-helper/third_party/btop. The helper adds its
  own main() and a small link shim (src/shim_linux.cpp) for the TUI globals
  btop's collectors reference; no btop source file is modified.

- btop4win (https://github.com/aristocratos/btop4win) — Apache-2.0 — will be
  vendored for the Windows backend (GPU/temperature via LibreHardwareMonitor,
  MPL-2.0, bundled separately) in a later phase.

A full copy of the Apache License 2.0 is available at
https://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0 and in each submodule's LICENSE
file.
